{"id": "Db8mOynBdB4", "title": "Video by wealthivora", "description": "I Opened an EU Company for $100 and \na Bank Account Paying 12% Interest \nFrom My Kitchen Table 🌍💰\n\nGeorgian banks pay 8 to 12 percent \nannual interest to foreign nationals \nwith minimal documentation.\n\nYour American savings account \npays you one percent.\n\nSame deposit. Same year.\nTwelve times the return.\n\nHere is what you will learn:\n- How to open a Georgian bank account \n  remotely paying 12% annual interest\n- How to set up an Estonian E-Residency \n  company for $100 at e-resident.gov.ee \n  without visiting Estonia\n- Why international tax deferral is \n  completely legal under the foreign \n  earned income exclusion threshold\n- How the entire setup runs from your \n  kitchen table while you eat cereal\n\nThe cereal is not a business expense.\nI checked.\n\nFull breakdown in The Money Nobody \nClaims — 45 methods, real numbers, \nreal steps, completely legal.\nLink is in my bio.\n\nPart 82 of the Unethical but Legal \nWays to Make Money series.\n\n——————————————————\nDISCLAIMER: Consult a licensed \ninternational tax attorney before \nopening foreign accounts or \nestablishing international entities.\n——————————————————\n\n#makemoney #estonia #georgia\n#eresidency #internationalbusiness\ntaxdeferral sidehustle moneytips\nfinancetips unethical legalways\nmakemoneyonline hustleculture\nfinancialfreedom stickman finance\nmoney digitalcreator wealthbuilding\nmoneymindset hustle wealthivora", "channel": "wealthivora", "uploader_id": "41312416009", "uploader": "Wealthivora | Personal Finance", "timestamp": 1786552246, "like_count": 49148, "comment_count": 229, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com